00:02:30.380 --> 00:02:31.380
Numbers.

00:02:31.380 --> 00:02:32.380
Yes, reading as well.

00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:33.380
Standing very still.

00:02:33.380 --> 00:02:35.820
Going "ooh" at the right moment, when the
