00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:48.700
Swording!

00:02:48.700 --> 00:02:49.200
Yes.

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:50.880
Swording!

00:02:50.880 --> 00:02:54.099
Which is an artless euphemism.

00:02:54.099 --> 00:02:55.880
Swording.

00:02:55.880 --> 00:02:59.910
