Singing and fencing at the same time
would be a hell of an act, wouldn't it?

00:03:47.320 --> 00:03:48.319
Opera.

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:52.840
Which I believe had been invented
at that point.

00:03:52.850 --> 00:03:54.709
And not only that; she joined an opera company.

00:03:54.709 --> 00:03:56.520
Have a point.

