00:05:57.180 --> 00:05:59.110
She must come with me immediately."

00:05:59.110 --> 00:06:02.790
And the nuns would go,
"Oh, a doctor has said so."

00:06:02.790 --> 00:06:05.640
Then the doctor would also have a sword,
and they…

00:06:07.120 --> 00:06:09.640
Yes, and they were listening, because he was
♪ SINGING ♪!

