00:06:46.960 --> 00:06:49.400
There's no DNA evidence, darling(!)

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:51.800
She escaped from that.

00:06:51.800 --> 00:06:52.960
The affair lasted three months,

00:06:52.960 --> 00:06:56.460
