00:07:09.350 --> 00:07:10.350
Something with swords?

00:07:10.350 --> 00:07:11.350
Yes, definitely.

00:07:11.350 --> 00:07:12.910
It's a sword thing, from this lady, I'm guessing.

00:07:12.910 --> 00:07:13.910
Yes.

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:14.910
Catastrophic juggling accident.

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:17.940
Oh, did she challenge someone to a duel?

00:07:17.940 --> 00:07:18.940
Yes, you're absolutely right.

00:07:18.940 --> 00:07:21.810
She was insulted by a young nobleman,
