00:08:17.250 --> 00:08:19.570
No, we're talking,
for this at least, much later.

00:08:19.570 --> 00:08:21.819
This is German military, 19th century.

00:08:21.819 --> 00:08:23.449
Oh, your full kit, no doubt.

00:08:23.449 --> 00:08:24.449
Armour?

00:08:24.449 --> 00:08:25.449
Well, you wouldn't be in armour.

00:08:25.449 --> 00:08:26.449
They wouldn't have armour at that point.

00:08:26.449 --> 00:08:27.449
