00:08:32.810 --> 00:08:34.669
Yes, you're absolutely right.

00:08:34.669 --> 00:08:39.399
They would fight with a mask and a thick scarf,
so you couldn't-

00:08:39.399 --> 00:08:41.019
Ah, so that you could only get this bit.

00:08:41.019 --> 00:08:42.550
You could only get that bit.

00:08:42.550 --> 00:08:45.279
